/** \defgroup runtime_programs Programs and operations
 * Build checked operations with cel::dyn_segment, freeze them as
 * cel::compiled_segment, and bind typed repeated calls with cel::prepared_segment.
 * See \ref runtime_get_started and \ref runtime_libraries for examples.
 */

/** \defgroup runtime_stack Reusable stacks
 * Keep caller-owned storage across evaluations. Reserve before entering a frame
 * and retain exclusive access to a stack throughout evaluation.
 * See \ref runtime_execution for storage and failure guarantees.
 */

/** \defgroup runtime_values Values and types
 * Describe complete semantic types and own scalar or aggregate results.
 * Concrete vectors and tuples use trusted boundary adapters; opaque client
 * leaves must be trivially copyable.
 */

/** \defgroup runtime_callables Callable results
 * Receive and invoke callable values whose frozen bodies outlive their builders.
 * Handles share code; they do not independently copy mutable callback captures.
 * See \ref runtime_callable_binding for complete signature and ownership rules.
 */

/** \example getting_started.cpp
 * Evaluates a prepared program twice on a reserved, reusable stack while
 * preserving caller-owned prefix storage.
 * See \ref runtime_get_started for the walkthrough.
 */
